--- Cleaning up Host ---
Running: systemctl stop model-download.service || true
ERR:
Failed to stop model-download.service: Unit model-download.service not loaded.
Running: systemctl disable model-download.service || true
ERR:
Failed to disable unit: Unit model-download.service does not exist

Running: rm /etc/systemd/system/model-download.service || true
ERR:
rm: cannot remove '/etc/systemd/system/model-download.service': No such file or
directory

Running: systemctl daemon-reload || true
Running: rm /opt/download.sh || true
ERR:
rm: cannot remove '/opt/download.sh': No such file or directory

--- Configuring LXC to use Ethernet (vmbr0) ---
Running: pct stop 107 || true
Running: pct set 107 --net0 name=eth0,bridge=vmbr0,ip=dhcp
Running: pct set 107 --nameserver ''
Running: pct start 107
OUT:
WARN: Systemd 255 detected. You may need to enable nesting.

ERR:
Task finished with 1 warning(s)!
Waiting 15s for Ethernet DHCP...
Running: pct exec 107 -- ping -c 1 8.8.8.8
ERR:
ping: connect: Network is unreachable

LXC still has no internet on Ethernet! Check cable.
